; The kit is consumed as a plain file: dependency from the sibling ImtCore checkout. npm's default for
; that is a SYMLINK, and a symlinked package resolves its own require('@playwright/test') against ITS
; real directory - where there is no node_modules - so it cannot load its peer dependency at all.
; Copy it in instead. See ImtCore/Tests/GuiTestKit/README.md ("Consuming this from an app").
install-links=true
